---
// FamiliarDesign.astro
---

<section class="section-wrapper familiar-section" id="familiar">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="familiar-card">
      <div class="familiar-content">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">Usability Without Relearning</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Familiar by design.</h2>

        <p class="familiar-lead">
          Some of the best ideas in file management have been around for years.
        </p>

        <div class="ideas-tag-cloud">
          <span class="idea-tag">Clear navigation</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Clickable breadcrumbs</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Tabs in one window</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Split views</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Drives &amp; capacity monitors</span>
          <span class="idea-tag">Obvious folder hierarchy</span>
        </div>

        <p class="familiar-body">
          Maggo brings those familiar ideas to macOS and combines them with a clean, native Mac experience.
        </p>

        <div class="familiar-quote-highlight">
          <span>You shouldn't have to learn a new way to manage files.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="familiar-visual">
        <div class="os-harmony-card">
          <div class="harmony-badge">The Best of Both Worlds</div>
          
          <div class="harmony-row">
            <div class="harmony-point">
              <span class="point-icon">🧭</span>
              <div class="point-text">
                <strong>Proven Navigation</strong>
                <span>Breadcrumbs, drive capacity meters, instant Move To/Copy To, and side-by-side split panels.</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="harmony-plus">+</div>

            <div class="harmony-point">
              <span class="point-icon">🍏</span>
              <div class="point-text">
                <strong>100% Native macOS</strong>
                <span>Written in Swift 6 &amp; SwiftUI. 120Hz ProMotion fluidity, native Quick Look (Space), and &lt;30MB RAM footprint.</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="harmony-footer">
            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
            <span>Zero learning curve. Open Maggo and instantly feel at home.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .familiar-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .familiar-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .familiar-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .familiar-lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .ideas-tag-cloud {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .idea-tag {
    background: #F1F5F9;
    border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
    color: #1E293B;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .familiar-body {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .familiar-quote-highlight {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .os-harmony-card {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .harmony-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    background: #EBF5FF;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .harmony-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .harmony-point {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .point-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .point-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .point-text strong {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .point-text span {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .harmony-plus {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #94A3B8;
  }

  .harmony-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #10B981;
    background: #ECFDF5;
    border: 1px solid #A7F3D0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .check-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
</style>
